{"unit_id":"cc39d84b22031bbfa692","title":"附件5.  第1 節 神經系統藥物 Drugs acting on the nervous system","kind":"attachment","blocks":[{"page":15,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p15-b12","raw_text":"附件5.  第1 節 神經系統藥物 Drugs acting on the nervous system \n","start_char":0,"end_char":54,"bbox":[49.20000076293945,556.4496459960938,550.1099853515625,574.1173706054688]},{"page":15,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p15-b13","raw_text":"1.6.3.Tolterodine L-tartrate  (如Detrusitol) ; solifenacin \n","start_char":0,"end_char":59,"bbox":[50.279998779296875,584.8860473632812,526.2134399414062,600.8460083007812]},{"page":15,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p15-b14","raw_text":"succinate  (如Vesicare)；mirabegron (如Betmiga):(90/7/1、\n","start_char":0,"end_char":54,"bbox":[76.10399627685547,620.916015625,540.2400512695312,636.8759765625]},{"page":15,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p15-b15","raw_text":"93/10/1、96/4/1、104/2/1) \n","start_char":0,"end_char":25,"bbox":[76.10399627685547,656.916015625,284.1700134277344,672.8759765625]},{"page":15,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p15-b16","raw_text":"1.限符合下列診斷標準條件之一者： \n","start_char":0,"end_char":19,"bbox":[64.34400177001953,692.916015625,328.33001708984375,708.8759765625]},{"page":15,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p15-b17","raw_text":"(1)頻尿：每天（24 小時）排尿次數超過八次，並有詳實病歷紀錄。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":35,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,728.916015625,555.4199829101562,744.8759765625]},{"page":16,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p16-b1","raw_text":"(2)急尿：病患自述經常有一種很突然、很強烈想解尿的感覺。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":31,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,46.136024475097656,519.4199829101562,62.09602355957031]},{"page":16,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p16-b2","raw_text":"(3)急迫性尿失禁：對於尿急的感覺無法控制，並於24 小時內至少也\n","start_char":0,"end_char":34,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,82.15604400634766,551.3717651367188,98.11604309082031]},{"page":16,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p16-b3","raw_text":"有一次漏尿之情形。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":11,"bbox":[94.10399627685547,118.15604400634766,246.11000061035156,134.1160430908203]},{"page":16,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p16-b4","raw_text":"2.不宜使用本類藥品者： \n","start_char":0,"end_char":14,"bbox":[64.34400177001953,154.15603637695312,248.26998901367188,170.1160430908203]},{"page":16,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p16-b5","raw_text":"(1)小兒夜尿。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":10,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,190.15603637695312,183.47000122070312,206.1160430908203]},{"page":16,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p16-b6","raw_text":"(2)單純性應力性尿失禁。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":15,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,226.15603637695312,263.3900146484375,242.1160430908203]},{"page":16,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p16-b7","raw_text":"(3)膀胱逼尿肌無反射（detrusor areflexia）或膀胱不收縮所引起之\n","start_char":0,"end_char":42,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,262.1860046386719,559.275146484375,278.14599609375]},{"page":16,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p16-b8","raw_text":"排尿困難或尿失禁之症狀。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":14,"bbox":[94.10399627685547,298.1860046386719,294.1300048828125,314.14599609375]},{"page":16,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p16-b9","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[36.0,333.4696044921875,39.9900016784668,351.1373291015625]}],"source_quality":[]}